## 🔌 Wiring / Muunganisho

### Jedwali la Muunganisho

| Kifaa | Pin ya Kifaa | Pin ya Arduino Uno |
|-------|-------------|-------------------|
| **OLED SSD1306** | VCC | 5V |
| | GND | GND |
| | SDA | A4 |
| | SCL | A5 |
| **Joystick Module** | VCC | 5V |
| | GND | GND |
| | VRx (X) | A0 |
| | VRy (Y) | A1 |
| | SW (kitufe) | D2 |
| **Servo 1 (X-axis)** | Signal | D9 |
| | VCC | 5V ya nje |
| | GND | GND ya nje |
| **Servo 2 (Y-axis)** | Signal | D10 |
| | VCC | 5V ya nje |
| | GND | GND ya nje |

### ⚠️ Onyo Muhimu

**Servo motors zinatumia nguvu nyingi!** Usizungushe servo mbili moja kwa moja kwenye 5V ya Arduino — inaweza kuharibu board.

**Tumia power supply ya nje kwa servo** na unganisha GND ya power supply na GND ya Arduino pamoja (common ground).

